<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1078725/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078726" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Clarissimo ac toto Orbe Celeberrimo
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johanni Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Ex <rs key="B_991170517052705501" type="letter">Litteris</rs> Doctissimi Agnati Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicola<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs> die 19 <choice><abbr>Dec:<hi rend="sup">bris</hi></abbr><expan>Decembris</expan></choice>
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teriti exaratis summo cum dolore intellexi Te neu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tiquam fore acceptaturum oblatum salarium
      <lb/>1500 Thalerorum, quorum quilibet sesquifloreno germa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nico <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quipollet, ac per consequens Te Patriam haud
      <lb/>esse derelicturum ut peregrinas in oras, ad Nos scilicet
      <lb/>discedas divers<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> religionis homines. Amplissimus Eques
      <lb/>et D. Marci Procurator <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzinus</rs> iis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <rs key="B_991170517052705501" type="letter">epistola</rs>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati</rs> Tui <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me intellectis doluit maxim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>, et admi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ratus est Tuam in petito Salario 1500 Thalerorum un<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cialium permanentiam. Ipse <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Nobilissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Moderator</rs>
      <lb/>maximo amore Tuam Personam omni virtutum
      <lb/>genere Spectatissimam prosequitur, Tibique hac
      <lb/>secunda vice ut offeram iubet salarium 1500
      <lb/>Thalerorum, quorum quilibet sesquifloreno germa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nico <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quivalet. Mandatis Tanti Moecenatis pareo
      <lb/>nec non te deprecor ut tandem accipias exhibit<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>salarium certa cum spe promovendi Agnat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs> post paucos annos; qui certe n<unclear>on</unclear>
<pb facs="1078727" n="2"/>
      <lb/>sine Tuo adventu ad Mathematum <rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nam</rs> non promovebitur etsi ego quotidi<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> rogem
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">os</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimos</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">os</hi></abbr><expan>Excellimos</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1178371670 pers_DE-588-1111043582" type="person">Moderatores</rs> adhoc ut eundem
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotem</rs> Tuum Stipendio ordinario Tui
      <lb/>loco promoveant. Ego rever<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> frequenter <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati</rs>
      <lb/>Tui merita, et eius maximam in Mathematicis habili<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatem commendo coram <choice><abbr>Ampliss.<hi rend="sup">is</hi></abbr><expan>Amplissimis</expan></choice> <rs type="organisation">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i Patavini</rs>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1178371670 pers_DE-588-1111043582" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs>: ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m ipsi, et pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim <choice><abbr>Ampliss:<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Amplissimus</expan></choice>
      <lb/>Procurator <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzinus</rs> Te cupiunt, Tibique offerunt
      <lb/>memoratum salarium etiam hac ultima vice
      <lb/>maius profect<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> exhibituri (Tua etenim
      <lb/>agnoscunt merita eximia) si id obtinere ipsi
      <lb/>possent, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> tua vocatione, ab hac Sereniss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi>
      <lb/>et Potentissima <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Republica</rs>. Tibi offerunt sala<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rium nemini ante Te in <rs type="organisation">Patavino Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>o</rs>
      <lb/>solutum; quare negari haud potest Te ab
      <lb/>ipsis honorifice vocari. In iis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Religio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem tuam respiciunt nullas apud Nos experie<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ris molestias, et <choice><abbr>potentiss.<hi rend="sup">am</hi></abbr><expan>potentissimam</expan></choice> huius <choice><abbr>Sereniss.<hi rend="sup"><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>Serenissimae</expan></choice> <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Rei
      <lb/>public<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> protectionem in omnibus obtinebis. Pauco
      <lb/>cum dispendio, sine paucis cum expensis vivere
<pb facs="1078728" n="3"/>
      <lb/>poteris <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavii</rs>. Cogita qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c omnia sed potissim<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>cordi habeto Agnati Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolai</rs> promotionem, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>cert<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> post aliquot annos (si <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs>
      <lb/>Te conferre non gravaberis) tuam promotionem se<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quetur maximo cum totius Domus tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> honore.
      <lb/>Mihi profect<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> iucundissima esset et Tui, et Agnati <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolai</rs> promotio; verum sine tua promotione, de vo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>catione celeberrimi Nepotis Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Ni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>colai</rs> (quem magni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>facio) desperatum est.</p>
  <p>Rogo Vir Doctissime ut responsum tale ad me ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nu tua propria transmittas quod possim ostendere
      <lb/>Amplissimo Moderatori <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzino</rs>, qui valde Te diligit,
      <lb/>et dolet, semperque dolebit si oblatum stipen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dium neutiquam acceptabis. Pro Thaleri valore
      <lb/>ipse semper intellexit sesquiflorenum germanic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>non ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> unciam unicam Argenti uti Tu semper in<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tellexisti Tuis in epistolis.</p>
  <p>Hac occasione Te rogare audeo Vir Celeberrime
      <lb/>ut mihi aliquam sequentis Problematis solutio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem mittas, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> uti potero in Dissertatione,
      <lb/>quam meditor de Legibus secretionis animalis.
<pb facs="1078729" n="4"/>
      <lb/>Sit fluidum datum ex heterogeneis fluidis
      <lb/>invicem per simplicem contactum mixtis com<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>positum; sit v. gr. fluidum ortum ex mixtura
      <lb/>aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, argenti vivi, Spiritus vini, Melis et Olei;
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sunt divers<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> densitatis, et consistenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> fluida.
      <lb/>Huiusmodi inquam fluidum viribus proiicienti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus, et nunquam cessantibus data quavis veloci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tate moveatur in canali conico, aut cilindrico
      <lb/>ramis Lateralibus referto; qui quidem ram
      <lb/>hient in canalis, siv<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> trunci cavitatem, et diver<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> amplitudinis, sed eiusdem figur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> orificiis gau<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deant pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> fluidis heterogeneis divers<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> densitatis et
      <lb/>consistenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> communi fluido, siv<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> a toto fluido
      <lb/>sequestrandis atque suscipiendis. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ritur cur in
      <lb/>ramos secretioni argenti vivi dicat<subst><del>is</del><add>os</add></subst>, non deriv<unclear>etur</unclear>
      <lb/>spiritus vini, aut aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> molecul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>? Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ritur pro
      <lb/>portio orificiorum <add>ramorum</add> secretioni aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, argenti vivi, spiritus vini, olei et Melis dicatorum, inter se
      <lb/>et proportio, quam eadem orificia habent ad
      <lb/>fluida pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dicta, <add>ad hoc ut dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> densitatis fluida suscipiant.</add> Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ritur proportio velocitatum
      <lb/>argenti vivi, spiritus vini, olei, aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> et Melis mixtim
      <lb/>communibus viribus proiectionis fluentibus in canali
      <lb/>conico, aut cilindrico duro, aut elastico. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c omnia Vir
<pb facs="1078730" n="5"/>
      <lb/>Amicissime respiciunt secretiones fluidorum, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>in Animalium, Hominumque corporibus quotidi<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>
      <lb/>fiunt <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> communi sanguinis massa; qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ex fluidis
      <lb/>heterogeneis, lympha puta, bile, saliva, semine,
      <lb/>pinguedine <choice><sic>ec</sic><corr>etc</corr></choice>. Coagmentatur, fluitque per arterias
      <lb/>et venas viribus cordis proiicientibus indesinenter
      <lb/>certa quadam velocitate; dimittitque per canali<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>culos laterales arteriarum evanescentium salivam
      <lb/>in glandulas salivales, semen in Testiculorum vas<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cula, bilem in ductus hepatarios, Lymphamque in vasa
      <lb/>Lymphatica. Semper ab Anatomicis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>situm fuit
      <lb/>cur Lympha in vasa secedat lymphatica, et non in
      <lb/>ductus hepatarios, aut in Testiculorum vascula, aut
      <lb/>in glandulas salivales; et cur spiritus animales (siqui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dem existant) utpote fluidum subtilissimum in
      <lb/>cerebri glandulas deriventur, et non in Renum aut
      <lb/>Intestinorum, vel Pancretis glandulas maioribus orificiis do<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatas?</p>
  <p>Vari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> fabul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> invent<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> hactenus fuere. Unus <rs key="pers_DE-588-117689548" type="person">Pitcarnius</rs>
      <lb/>ad diversam orificiorum amplitudinem in vasis
      <lb/>secernentibus confugit sed nescio an felici successu id
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stiterit. Poenes Te esto iudicium.</p> <closer><salute>Vale, saluta
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimum</expan></choice> Agnatum Tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs> (ad quem ut res<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ponsoriam <choice><sic>transmitam</sic><corr>transmittam</corr></choice> epistolam temporis angustia haud
      <lb/>patitur<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti beantwortet Nicolaus I Bernoullis <rs key="B_991170517052705501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 19. Dezember 1714 mit seinem <rs key="B_991170517052505501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 22. Februar 1715. Zu Beginn begründet er die Verzögerung mit der Vielzahl seiner Geschäfte.</note>) meque amare non desine.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <unclear>a</unclear>die <date when="1715-01-25">25 Januarii
      <lb/>An. 1715</date></dateline></closer>
